{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join schoolgirl superhero Reya and her manager Nio as they embark on their journey as Hero Content Creators, fighting monstrous beings that emerge daily from another dimension. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Prepare for <strong>electrifying aerial superhero battles</strong>, boasting intuitive controls that anyone can master. Use the camera to lock onto targets effortlessly, then unleash a torrent of attacks with the push of a button. Dive into combat at exhilarating speeds, delivering lightning-fast strikes and chaining combos effortlessly. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/extras/cc0784a9072acce4afd9ca7709412944.poster.avif?t=1772219713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/extras/cc0784a9072acce4afd9ca7709412944.webm?t=1772219713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/extras/cc0784a9072acce4afd9ca7709412944.mp4?t=1772219713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience<strong> sensational combat against unexpected otherworldly threats</strong>, from small creatures to gigantic monsters. Unleash your power and send them crashing into floors and walls in anime-style showdowns! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/extras/9f5cf7acbf4999ae85a6717ac7cba2ca.poster.avif?t=1772219713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/extras/9f5cf7acbf4999ae85a6717ac7cba2ca.webm?t=1772219713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/extras/9f5cf7acbf4999ae85a6717ac7cba2ca.mp4?t=1772219713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow an engaging cast through the <strong>fun and cheerful hero streamer's story</strong>! Featuring a stylish female protagonist, colorful side characters and creatively designed enemies. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/extras/3e985b31f5b86ea6aa70ffc6b4db854d.poster.avif?t=1772219713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/extras/3e985b31f5b86ea6aa70ffc6b4db854d.webm?t=1772219713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/extras/3e985b31f5b86ea6aa70ffc6b4db854d.mp4?t=1772219713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of <strong>3 iconic weapons and over 30 unique actions and attacks </strong>to execute unique combos and jaw-dropping finishers to obliterate your foes. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/extras/ad3cf95672d0e36b2594bdbf9582052c.poster.avif?t=1772219713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/extras/ad3cf95672d0e36b2594bdbf9582052c.webm?t=1772219713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/extras/ad3cf95672d0e36b2594bdbf9582052c.mp4?t=1772219713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 3<strong>8 stages and face 24 enemy types</strong> including powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/extras/7dbfc6dc03bf95ba965467b33e1f3a58.poster.avif?t=1772219713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/extras/7dbfc6dc03bf95ba965467b33e1f3a58.webm?t=1772219713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/extras/7dbfc6dc03bf95ba965467b33e1f3a58.mp4?t=1772219713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anime-inspired, heart-pounding hero action is waiting for you!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3077640?t=1772219713","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/b50c30efe1e340242bbae84260dd575603b406b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772219713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/4b6a59a7dd9aad5894eea65374753fd8484c2408/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772219713","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077640/4b6a59a7dd9aad5894eea65374753fd8484c2408/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772219713","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game features themes and outfits that may be deemed suggestive.\r\nMIGHTREYA is a w